                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} P_{m,n}
              are certain (see the reference for their calculation)
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universal+polynomial"} universal polynomials
              with integer coefficients.
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi R
