          %p
            This is originally due to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexander+Grothendieck"} Alexander Grothendieck
            %a{:href => "topological+K-theory#Wirthmuller12"} Wirthmuller 12, section 11
            and see at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Adams+operations"} Adams operations
          %p
            Generalizing to
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+K-theory"} equivariant K-theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/representation+ring"} representation ring
            of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group"} group
            inherits the structure of a Lambda-ring, see
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "representation+ring#LambdaRingStructure"} there
          .num_example
            %h6#example_4 Example
            %p
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+elliptic+cohomology"} equivariant elliptic cohomology
              at the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Tate+curve"} Tate curve
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi Ell
                      %mi Tate
